<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants carried out a deadly attack near the Kenya-Somalia border, killing eight people in Mandera, while Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing three. The Somali National Army killed senior Al-Shabaab commanders in Lower Shabelle and reported killing 76 militants in central Somalia, and the group claimed responsibility for assassinating a Somali intelligence officer in Mogadishu after a ten-year pursuit. Somalia condemned the Mandera attack that killed eight Kenyan citizens and offered condolences to Egypt after a train collision killed seven. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPSHh5LTlGajl3WFlBbHE4ZWR5dG1FX3VGMm5DV0lIeGhsNXBoOHFweHN3ZFI0TkxVWDlod3ZzaGVuN2VVZk82NE5nWVAxU0xSdVVLNzZvUmFYWE9Jc1lnMGFGaE9RZ2k5X2lvVFY1WFVBdmpXSHl1NFZqZTZEbmtySWh4TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxORnE5eVJQVzRRNFU5emQ3TWdkQ2h3bUJkYWFLblJEMnhtZ0JlSUlQc20teFBaM1U4bXZaUnp2WVNaMTlkNi1vSE1EdXFjVDE4VEpOYXBGTThIby1PRzJQdXdTUU5CdHRUUkwzeENsa3